                        data-aos-delay="0"
                        data-aos-easing="ease-out-cubic"><div><h2 class="text-accent2">What makes studying in <span class="text-nowrap">Central Florida so perfect?</span></h2></div><p class="mb-0">The Orlando area has a variety of attractions,
                        from beaches ready for splashing to scenic parks perfect for biking to world-famous theme parks.
