                                alt="Expanding the Field"
                                src="/ssap/assets/source/website/homepage/expanding-the-field.svg"><p class="p-3 mt-3 ml-lg-3">
                            Dr. Janell Robinson knows that a well-built network is important not only for computers, but people too. She aims to include more women and people of color into STEM areas and designed the curriculum for former Orlando Magic forward Aaron Gordon’s inaugural CodeOrlando summer camp for underprivileged youth.
