                                alt="Learning the Business"
                                src="/ssap/assets/source/website/homepage/learning-the-business.svg"><p class="p-3 mt-3 ml-lg-3">
                            Rachel Yang is getting a hands-on education while pursuing her bachelor’s degree. As a part of the work-study program, Rachel is working with the College’s Marketing and Communications team on everything from snapping the perfect Instagram photo for the College’s platforms to volunteering at events on campus.
                                                                                </p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="spotlight d-none "><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-12 px-0"><div class="d-md-flex"><div class="col-md-6 spotlightImgHolder px-0 d-flex align-items-center "><picture><source media="(min-width: 1200px)"
