                                alt="Around The World"
                                src="/ssap/assets/source/website/homepage/around-the-world.svg"><p class="p-3 mt-3 ml-lg-3">
                            Brandon Widener made his childhood dream come true. After watching “The Lion King” as a child, he fell in love with the film industry. Attending Seminole State and completing his associate degree in multimedia technology gave Brandon the skills he needed to land a job working for Disney XD in Los Angeles.
