                                    srcset="/ssap/assets/source/website/homepage/4-distance-md.jpg"><source media="(min-width: 1px)"
                                    srcset="/ssap/assets/source/website/homepage/4-distance-sm.jpg"><img class="img-fluid lazyload"
                                    alt="A man standing in an asile surrounded by shoe boxes"
                                    src="/ssap/assets/source/website/utility/img-alt.png"></picture></div><div class="col-md-6 spotlightContentHolder d-flex flex-column justify-content-center align-items-center align-items-md-left order-0"><img class="img-fluid mt-3 mt-md-0"
                                alt="Going The Distance"
                                src="/ssap/assets/source/website/homepage/going-the-distance.svg"><p class="p-3 mt-3 ml-lg-3">
                            Jon Hughes keeps Orlando running. Literally. With his associate degree in business from Seminole State, Jon put his lifelong passion of long-distance running to use and owns Track Shack, a specialty running store near downtown Orlando.
                                                                                        <br><a class="btn fs-lg mt-1 pl-0 fw-bold text-white"
